JUjZwZG42dm1SRzI4SWtjTFgxS3VhU21Ycm16dlZHV0hwcXp4UkVaUkRxUVQ0NXBiazA0TA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"斗山製造交易推動 NuScale Power 股價上漲 7%； Oklo 和 BWX 技術路線"},{"title":"NuScale Power Corporation (SMR) stock price, news, quote and history","src":"Yahoo Finance Singapore","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFA3Wm5PR3B0bzFuUGk4enBicTFSaHNDdXZRcG0tSVltdEVWclpHVmtVRW9nelJCVkp6cDFuTUJDYVpiX3JRc240QzJabjd2R1JT?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"NuScale Power Corporation (SMR) 股票價格、新聞、報價和歷史"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":7},{"name":"能源/電力","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1822966/000182296626000018/smr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Unless the context otherwise requires, all references in this section to \"NuScale,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our\" refer to the consolidated operations of NuScale Corp and NuScale LLC.","zh":"除非上下文另有要求，本節中所有提及的「NuScale」、「本公司」、「我們」、「我們」或「我們的」均指 NuScale Corp 和 NuScale LLC 的合併營運。"},{"en":"NuScale is redefining nuclear power through the development of proprietary and innovative SMR technology that the Company believes will deliver safe, scalable, cost-effective and reliable carbon-free power. The Company's core technology, the Light Water Nuclear Reactor NuScale Power Module (\"NPM\"), can generate 77 MWe and is premised on well-established nuclear technology principles, with a focus on the integration of components, simplification or elimination of systems and use of passive safety features. The Company believes this results in a safe and highly reliable power plant suitable to be sited close to where electricity, water desalinization, hydrogen production or process heat is needed.","zh":"NuScale 正在透過開發專有和創新的 SMR 技術重新定義核電，該公司相信該技術將提供安全、可擴展、經濟高效且可靠的無碳電力。該公司的核心技術是輕水核反應器 NuScale 功率模組（「NPM」），可產生 77 MWe 的電力，以完善的核子技術原理為前提，重點是組件整合、系統簡化或消除以及非能動安全功能的使用。該公司相信，這將產生一個安全且高度可靠的發電廠，適合建在需要電力、海水淡化、氫氣製造或製程熱的地方附近。"},{"en":"Since 2007, over $1.8 billion has been invested in the development of NuScale technology, including more than $578.3 million from DOE under a series of cost-share programs, and we have received 513 patents globally, with an additional 268 patent applications currently pending. In September 2020, the Company's 12-module design (currently approved for 160 million watts of thermal power or 50 MWe per NPM) became the first and only SMR to receive an SDA from the Nuclear Regulatory Commission (\"NRC\"). In the U.S., the NRC oversees the licensing, permitting, and decommissioning of nuclear sites. In May 2025, the NRC finalized their review and approved the Company's second SDA application and the associated licensing topical reports for NuScale's 6-unit 77 MWe NPM design. Customers in the United States are now able to reference the approved design and SDA for expedited construction and operatin","zh":"自 2007 年以來，我們已在 NuScale 技術的開發上投入了超過 18 億美元，其中包括美國能源部根據一系列成本分攤計劃提供的超過 5.783 億美元，我們已在全球範圍內獲得了 513 項專利，目前還有 268 項專利申請正在審批中。 2020年9月，該公司的12模組設計（目前已批准用於1.6億瓦的火力或每NPM 50 MWe）成為第一個也是唯一一個獲得核管理委員會（“NRC”）SDA的SMR。在美國，NRC 負責監督核設施的許可、許可和退役。 2025 年 5 月，NRC 完成了審查並批准了該公司的第二次 SDA 申請以及 NuScale 6 台 77 MWe NPM 設計的相關許可主題報告。美國的客戶現在可以參考批准的設計和 SDA 來加快建設和運營"}],"markets":[{"en":"NuScale has determined that it currently operates in a single segment and will periodically reassess that determination as it nears commercialization and deployment of its NPMs.","zh":"NuScale 已確定其目前在單一細分市場運營，並將在其 NPM 接近商業化和部署時定期重新評估此決定。"},{"en":"The Company's core technology, the NuScale Power Module (\"NPM\"), can generate 77 MWe and is premised on well-established nuclear technology principles, with a focus on the integration of components, simplification or elimination of systems and use of passive safety features.","zh":"該公司的核心技術 NuScale 功率模組（“NPM”）可產生 77 MWe 的電力，以完善的核技術原理為前提，重點是組件整合、系統簡化或消除以及被動安全功能的使用。"}],"customers":[{"en":"RoPower/Nuclearelectrica. On November 4, 2021, NuScale and Nuclearelectrica, a national energy company in Romania that produces electricity, heat and nuclear fuel, signed a teaming agreement to advance the delivery of NuScale's SMR technology. NuScale and RoPower, which is owned in equal shares by Nuclearelectrica and Nova Power & Gas S.A., announced on January 4, 2023, that a contract for the preliminary work required prior to beginning the Front-End Engineering and Design (\"FEED\") work was signed between the parties on December 28, 2022. After completing the pre-FEED work, in July 2024, NuScale and RoPower signed a technology licensing agreement, which grants RoPower a right to use certain intellectual property of NuScale's. In the third quarter of the 2024 fiscal year, Nuclearelectrica and RoPower signed the FEED Phase 2 contract with Fluor, a related party to NuScale. FEED Phase 2 in","zh":"RoPower/核電。 2021 年 11 月 4 日，NuScale 與生產電力、熱力和核燃料的羅馬尼亞國家能源公司 Nuclearelectrica 簽署了一項合作協議，以推進 NuScale SMR 技術的交付。 NuScale 與 Nuclearelectrica 和 Nova Power & Gas S.A. 持股的 RoPower 於 2023 年 1 月 4 日宣布，雙方於 2022 年 12 月 28 日簽署了開始前端工程和設計（「FEED」）工作之前所需的前期工作合約。在完成前端工程和設計（「FEED」）工作後，2024 年 7 月，NuScale 和 RoPower 簽署了一份技術授權協議，該協議授予 RoPower 使用的權利。 NuScale 的某些智慧財產權。 2024財年第三季度，Nuclearelectrica和RoPower與NuScale的關聯方Fluor簽署了FEED第二階段合約。飼料第 2 階段"},{"en":"ENTRA1. The Company has partnered with ENTRA1, NuScale's global strategic partner for commercialization and development of power plants utilizing NPMs. ENTRA1 holds the exclusive rights for the worldwide commercialization, distribution, sales and development of Company products, services and power plants. Through this strategic relationship, the Company expects to collaborate on joint development initiatives with ENTRA1. To this end, on August 27, 2025, NuScale LLC and ENTRA1 executed a Partnership Milestones Agreement (\"PMA\"). Under the PMA, the Company will make milestone contributions (\"Milestone Contribution\") to ENTRA1, or its designated affiliate, for each NPM or other NuScale product that is anticipated to be placed in a contemplated project or power plant (each, an \"Energy Project\"). Under the PMA, NuScale is named as the key supplier for future ENTRA1 Energy Projects with respec","zh":"ENTRA1。該公司與 NuScale 的全球戰略合作夥伴 ENTRA1 合作，利用 NPM 進行發電廠的商業化和開發。 ENTRA1 擁有公司產品、服務和發電廠的全球商業化、分銷、銷售和開發的獨家權利。透過這種策略關係，公司希望與 ENTRA1 合作開展聯合開發計劃。為此，NuScale LLC 和 ENTRA1 於 2025 年 8 月 27 日簽署了合作夥伴里程碑協議（「PMA」）。根據 PMA，公司將為預計將部署到預期項目或發電廠（均稱為「能源項目」）的每個 NPM 或其他 NuScale 產品向 ENTRA1 或其指定附屬公司做出里程碑貢獻（「里程碑貢獻」）。根據 PMA，NuScale 被指定為未來 ENTRA1 能源項目的主要供應商"}],"competition":[{"en":"NuScale's competitors are other power generation technologies, including traditional baseload, renewables, long duration storage and other nuclear reactors, including SMRs. The Company's competitive strengths differentiate us from the competition globally, in part because NuScale's SMR technology is currently the only NRC-approved SMR technology capable of meeting the growing demand for carbon-free baseload generation.","zh":"NuScale 的競爭對手是其他發電技術，包括傳統基荷、再生能源、長期儲存和其他核反應器，包括 SMR。該公司的競爭優勢使我們在全球競爭中脫穎而出，部分原因是 NuScale 的 SMR 技術是目前唯一獲得 NRC 批准、能夠滿足不斷增長的無碳基本負載發電需求的 SMR 技術。"},{"en":"Carbon-Free Energy. According to BloombergNEF, more than 40% of the world's electricity came from zero-carbon sources in 2023, including wind, solar, hydroelectric and large-scale nuclear. Among these technologies, only nuclear is highly reliable, cost-effective, dispatchable and land use efficient. Additionally, since renewables are weather-dependent, they are too unreliable to support certain end-use cases, including mission-critical applications or industrial applications that require extensive on-site, always-available power. Due to their innovative design, NuScale SMR-based power plants can operate as baseload generation, load-follow renewables and/or support key industrial applications.","zh":"無碳能源。根據彭博新能源財經報道，到2023年，全球超過40%的電力來自零碳能源，包括風能、太陽能、水力發電和大型核能。在這些技術中，只有核能具有高可靠性、成本效益、可調度性和土地利用效率。此外，由於再生能源依賴天氣，因此它們太不可靠，無法支援某些最終用途案例，包括需要大量現場、始終可用的電力的關鍵任務應用或工業應用。由於其創新設計，基於 NuScale SMR 的發電廠可以作為基本負載發電、負載追蹤再生能源和/或支援關鍵工業應用。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Power Plant & NPM Engineering Design & Licensing Services & Fees","val":30077000,"zh":"發電廠及 NPM 工程設計及授權服務及費用"},{"name":"E2Centers","val":1268000,"zh":"E2中心"},{"name":"Other","val":134000,"zh":"其他"}],"total":31479000}},"peers":["OKLO","NNE","LEU","CEG","VST"]}}